    "BatteryCenter loaded and answered, but reported no connected devices. Its XPC to powerd is denied: the console shows _BCPowerSourceController \"Failed to obtain power sources info\"." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BatteryCenter yükləndi və cavab verdi, ancaq heç bir bağlı cihaz bildirmedi. onun powerd-ə XPC rədd edilir: konsol _BCPowerSourceController \"Güc mənbələri məlumatını əldə etmə uğursuz\" göstərir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BatteryCenter 已加载并有响应，但未报告任何已连接设备。它对 powerd 的 XPC 被拒绝：控制台会出现 _BCPowerSourceController \"Failed to obtain power sources info\"。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BatteryCenter loaded but BCBatteryDeviceController is not in the runtime." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BatteryCenter yükləndi, ancaq BCBatteryDeviceController runtime-da deyil."
